				(description "CANNOT DETERMINE. A leadless moulded part marked '1A8' / '1950' exists at this location and that is ALL that is established. Even its function - 'secondary regulator' - is an inference, which is why every pin name here ends in a question mark. Its output is wired to nothing on this sheet because nothing in the record says what it feeds.  [pinout: bom/bom.json U9 (CANNOT DETERMINE for the part number; HIGH only for 'a part bearing these two lines exists here').]")
